# Security headers (applied by Cloudflare to all routes)
# NOTE: do NOT set Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy here — a stricter COOP than the
# browser default ("unsafe-none") severs the Google Sign-In popup's connection
# back to the page and breaks login. Leaving COOP unset is what works.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
